id: god-of-an-element
name: God of an Element
optionOf: divine-magic
# "Select a Profile with 'Elemental' in the name" - asked when it is added, `$choice`.
choose: elementalProfile
description: An Elemental Profile of your choice becomes a Favored Element.
text: >
  God of an Element [Passive]: Upon gaining this effect, select a Profile with 'Elemental' in the name - it becomes a
  Favored Element (see - Favored Element).

---

[passive]
favored.$choice = true;
